\par
\tab a) Creation of most of the system components of both the \ul LAP6-\ulnone\par
\tab    \ul DIAL\ulnone\sub 20\nosupersub  and \ul DIAL-MS\ulnone\sub 20\nosupersub  operating systems for the PDP-12\sub 99\nosupersub .\line\line\tab b) Author of the famous GT-40 demonstration program known as\par
