 41.\tab FOCAL-71\par
\par
\tab Another edition of PDP-8\sub 99\nosupersub  FOCAL\sub 38\nosupersub  beyond FOCAL, 1969\sub 40\nosupersub  was\par
\tab released in 1971 as FOCAL-8\sub 42\nosupersub ; however, this was also the title\par
\tab of the main documentation file for FOCAL, 1969\sub 40\nosupersub  (and to some\par
\tab extent a prior release mentioned within the document).  Since \tab releases of PDP-8\sub 99\nosupersub  FOCAL\sub 38\nosupersub  were generally associated with release\par
\tab dates (and to avoid confusion), this version became known as\par
 \tab FOCAL-71.\par
\par
\tab While this release includes the minor bug fix for the "for" \tab command, there are several problematic issues.  See FOCAL-8\sub 42\nosupersub .\page\cf3 Glossary of Terms (continued)\par
