\tab    hardware failure.  This was deliberately designed to cause\par
 \tab    potential customers to lose confidence in the DCC product\par
\tab    reliability.\par
\par
\tab    Note: The source code of FOCAL-8\sub 99\nosupersub  was never released.\par
