\tab submitted to DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub ; this was a feeble attempt to accomplish a few\par
\tab goals as follows:\par
\par
\tab a) While the software is actually a legitimate and serious\par
\tab    product, the WCFMPG members are generally not serious at all.\par
\tab    It became necessary to add some credibility so DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub  personnel\par
\tab    would accept the submission (and not reject it as merely a\par
\tab    joke).\cf3\par
\cf0\par
\tab    However, the process was further hampered by the actual DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub\par
\tab    submission performed by Stan Rabinowitz of the P?S, since he\par
\tab    is generally regarded as having even less credibility than the\par
\tab    members of the WCFMPG.  (Mr. Rabinowitz has been accused of\par
\tab    various shenanigans over the course of many years.  We cannot\par
