\cf0\par
\tab    Note: There are surviving documents for MS/8 available from\par
\tab    the author of this document (indicating the \ul R-L Monitor System\ulnone  \tab    and not MS/8).  Presumably, paper copies were actually\par
\tab    submitted to the DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub  office within DEC's main headquarters,\par
\tab    including the author's documentation regarding his work on\par
\tab    FOCAL for the \ul R-L Monitor System\ulnone .\par
\par
\tab b) The entire event was a thinly disguised attempt at poking fun\par
\tab    at the then-current DEC marketing practice of creating too\par
\tab    many similar products with confusingly similar names to \par
\tab    describe different operating system releases that are even\par
\tab    more confusing when stated in contracted form followed by \cf2\highlight3\f0 /8\cf0\highlight0\f1 .\par
\par
\tab    Note: This has led to the serious problem of difficulty in\par
