\par
\tab The influential effect of releasing the \ul R-L Monitor System\ulnone  to\ul  \ulnone\tab DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub  as \ul MS/8\ulnone  (DECUS\sub 15\nosupersub  8-466) continues with the logical follow-on\par
\tab system being \tab known as P?S/8.  (The P?S/8 patch log is the\par
\tab primary subject of this document.)  This action continues the\par
\tab\i tradition\i0  of poking fun at DEC managerial decisions; DEC \tab management was invariably clueless about these issues and just\par
