 \tab    student project.\par
\par
\tab e) \ul\i EDUSYSTEM 15-30\ulnone  \i0 is a specific variant of EDUSYSTEM 30 that\par
\tab    runs only on the TD8E DECtape.  Either 8K of memory or the\par
\tab    MR8E-C support ROM is required.\par
\par
\tab    Note: When the MR8E-C ROM is used, it is located in field 7 of\par
\tab    memory in locations 77400-77777.  As such, the host PDP-8/E\par
\tab    (or similar) system must support extended memory for either\par
\tab    configuration.  It is believed that, out of expediency, the\par
\tab    technique of using an internal buffer during Slurp loading is\par
\tab    deployed in this system despite the ability to implement an\par
\tab    appropriate hardware-specific version; P?S/8 implements a\par
\tab    TD8E-specific Slurp format binary\i  \i0 loader for the identical\par
